Z||000001||BAM-BAM||08-15-2001||12:22 AM||||  Hey DAD, How ya been. The wheels are Konig Monsoons, and the Tires are Kumho Ecsta 712's and they sit nicely on the Eibach Sport springs. I also have the KYB combo at the corners and Poly's on the control arms. Right now I am in the middle of finishing my interior (which will probably change once Aus gets the "Retro" done) and building up my 3.4L. I have all the components for the engine, just need more hours in a day. <BR>  Actually the story on the wheels is in the search somewhere. I will dig it up and post it as a reply. Good to hear from you, take care and let me know when you might be this way again. Sorry I missed you in July. <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/007232.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/007232.html</A>  <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/006870.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/006870.html</A> <P>Peace, B2 OUT!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>[This message has been edited by BAM-BAM (edited 08-15-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by BAM-BAM (edited 08-15-2001).]||||reg||12
